Compat before-patch for b58-mcp-admission, applied to 7655b8a20 (coordinator decision 2).

The current checks name EngineAdmissionException.Reason.INFERENCE_BUSY, which 7655b8a20 lacks. This
patch adds only that constant, plus the minimal case arms that exhaustive switches over Reason need
to compile: ConversationEngine, ApiErrorHandler and RequestEngineWork (production), and the
before-state test ApiErrorHandlerResolveTest (not one of the checks). Each arm throws
IllegalStateException("compat: unreachable before-state reason"). Nothing in the before-state
produces this reason, so no before-state behaviour changes.

diff --git a/modules/app-api/src/main/java/io/justsearch/app/api/EngineAdmissionException.java b/modules/app-api/src/main/java/io/justsearch/app/api/EngineAdmissionException.java
index d6a154814..32e39c1f1 100644
--- a/modules/app-api/src/main/java/io/justsearch/app/api/EngineAdmissionException.java
+++ b/modules/app-api/src/main/java/io/justsearch/app/api/EngineAdmissionException.java
@@ -4,7 +4,9 @@ package io.justsearch.app.api;
 /** A typed admission refusal, independent from operation dispatch authorization. */
 public final class EngineAdmissionException extends RuntimeException {
   private static final long serialVersionUID = 1L;
-  public enum Reason { CONTEXT_LIMIT, ENGINE_LIMIT, FROZEN, WORK_FINISHED }
+  // Compatibility only (compat before-patch): INFERENCE_BUSY lets later checks compile; nothing in
+  // this state produces it, and every exhaustive switch over Reason throws for it.
+  public enum Reason { CONTEXT_LIMIT, ENGINE_LIMIT, INFERENCE_BUSY, FROZEN, WORK_FINISHED }
 
   private final Reason reason;
   private final int retryAfterSeconds;
diff --git a/modules/app-services/src/main/java/io/justsearch/app/services/conversation/ConversationEngine.java b/modules/app-services/src/main/java/io/justsearch/app/services/conversation/ConversationEngine.java
